"subs": {
"c01": "Good evening, and welcome to the Meme Royale Championship Final!",
"b01": "A sell-out crowd tonight, Chip. Which is remarkable, because the game is free.",
"c02": "In the red corner, the undefeated champion. Giga!",
"b02": "Forty-four wins. No losses. He has never once checked the price.",
"c03": "And in the blue corner, the challenger. Pepe.",
"b03": "Down ninety-nine percent, and somehow still here. I admire it. I don't understand it.",
"c04": "And we're under way! Giga opens with the Whale, straight down the left!",
"b04": "Lovely movement from the Whale. He moves markets, that one.",
"c05": "And Pepe's response is... nothing. He's played nothing.",
"b05": "He's holding, Chip. It's all he knows.",
"c06": "Tower down! The Whale goes straight through it!",
"b06": "Let's see that again. Here's the tower. Tower's fine. Still fine. And there's the Whale.",
"c07": "You can't coach that.",
"b07": "No. He's simply enormous.",
"c08": "The second tower's gone! And the blue fans are heading for the exits!",
"b08": "Paper hands, the lot of them. They'll be back at the top.",
"c09": "Pepe has one card left. One. And he's playing it.",
"c10": "It's... Useless.",
"b09": "That's not my opinion, Chip. That is the name of the card.",
"c11": "He's just... walking. Nobody's marking him!",
"b10": "Well, why would you? He's Useless.",
"c12": "He's at the tower. He's at the king's tower!",
"c13": "Useless has done it! Pepe is the champion!",
"b11": "Forty-four and one. I have never seen anything like it. Mostly because I looked away.",
"c14": "Pepe! The new champion! Your thoughts?",
"b12": "Telling no one. Magnificent.",
"c15": "Meme Royale. Free to play. We'll be right back after these messages.",
"b13": "There are no messages. It's free."
},
